.el .ds Aq '
.TH flightlog-list 1 2026-09-30 "flightlog 0.3.0" "flightlog manual"
.SH NAME
flightlog\-list \- List sessions recorded for a directory, newest first
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBflightlog list\fR [\fB\-\-skip\-path\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-tool\fR] [\fB\-\-cwd\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-size\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-checksums\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-format\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-content\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-overwrite\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-http\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-unredacted\fR] [\fB\-\-yolo\fR] [\fB\-\-redact\-file\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List sessions recorded for a directory, newest first
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-path\-checks\fR
Allow traversal, absolute destinations and filesystem symlinks
.TP
\fB\-\-tool\fR \fI<TOOL>\fR
Only this tool\*(Aqs sessions
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
claude: Claude Code
.IP \(bu 2
codex: OpenAI Codex CLI
.IP \(bu 2
opencode: opencode
.IP \(bu 2
gemini: Gemini CLI
.IP \(bu 2
cursor: Cursor CLI (cursor\-agent) and the Cursor editor
.IP \(bu 2
copilot\-vscode: GitHub Copilot chat in VS Code and compatible editors
.IP \(bu 2
copilot: GitHub Copilot CLI
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-cwd\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Directory the sessions ran in [default: current directory]
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-size\-checks\fR
Disable Flightlog archive, entry and input size limits
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-checksums\fR
Ignore manifest SHA\-256 mismatches (ZIP decoding must still succeed)
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-format\-checks\fR
Skip bundle schema and file\-inventory validation
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-content\-checks\fR
Skip input redaction and opaque\-content checks, regardless of manifest mode
.TP
\fB\-\-overwrite\fR
Replace existing outputs and restore files; merge extraction directories
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-http\fR
Permit plaintext HTTP transfers
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-unredacted\fR
Accept explicitly unredacted bundles for private migration
.TP
\fB\-\-yolo\fR
Disable redaction and every bypassable safety check; overwrite outputs
.TP
\fB\-\-redact\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
File of private literal names/domains to redact (one per line; kept local)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
.B COPILOT_HOME
Copilot CLI configuration and state directory (default ~/.copilot).
.TP
.B COPILOT_VSCODE_USER_DATA_DIR
VS Code compatible editor user data root (the directory containing User).
By default, Code, Code Insiders and VSCodium user data locations are searched.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR flightlog (1)
